Package: datapond
Title: Simple Data Lake Infrastructure for R with DuckLake
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", email = "cathal470@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: SUPERSEDED - please use the 'ducklake' package on CRAN
    (<https://github.com/tgerke/ducklake-r>) instead. Provides a unified R
    interface for DuckLake, a modern data lakehouse format built on DuckDB.
    Supports ACID transactions, time travel queries, schema evolution, and
    Iceberg export. This package is archived and no longer maintained.
